# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Finder is fully functional with NO keys at all: it defaults to OpenStreetMap
# (Overpass + Nominatim), which covers the entire globe for free.
# Everything below is optional.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: enables the "Google Places" data source in the source switcher, and
# with it the only source of ratings, reviews and reliable store photos.
# Needs the Places API (New) enabled on the key. Nearby Search and Place
# Details are billed per request.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the Overpass instance (comma-separated list, tried in order).
# OVERPASS_ENDPOINTS=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter,https://overpass.kumi.systems/api/interpreter

# Optional: contact string sent in the User-Agent to OSM services, as their
# usage policy asks for. Set this to your own email/URL before heavy use.
# OSM_CONTACT=you@example.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Basemaps. The default is OpenStreetMap's own tile service, which needs no key
# and always works. Both options below are about getting nicer-looking tiles.
#
# NOTE: anything named NEXT_PUBLIC_* is compiled into the JavaScript the browser
# downloads, so treat these as public. That is unavoidable for map tiles — the
# browser fetches them directly — so restrict the key to your domain in the
# provider's dashboard rather than relying on it staying secret. Never commit a
# real key to the repository; set it in your host's environment variables.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: a CARTO Basemaps key switches the street and dark styles to CARTO,
# and gives a real dark basemap instead of the CSS-filtered fallback.
# Free up to 5,000,000 tile requests a month. Get one at carto.com/basemaps/apikey
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CARTO_API_KEY=

# Optional: any other provider (MapTiler, Stadia, your own tile server). This
# wins over the CARTO key above. Include the whole URL template.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors &copy; MapTiler
